# Alarmy

> Alarmy is the world's #1 alarm clock app, with over 110 million downloads and 75 million users across 97 countries. Built by Delightroom, Alarmy is known for mission-based alarms that prevent snoozing and help heavy sleepers actually wake up. The Alarmy blog publishes evidence-informed guides on sleep science, wake-up habits, circadian rhythm, alarm strategies, and morning routines.

## Core pages

- [Alarmy Home](https://alar.my/en): Overview of the Alarmy app, mission-based alarms, sleep tracking, and download links for iOS and Android
- [Alarmy Blog](https://alar.my/en/blog): Sleep science and wake-up habit guides written for people who struggle to wake up

